      </example>
      <para id="para-00040">What patterns do you notice? Can you use those ideas to find the vertices for the next equation? What do you know about whether it will open up or down?</para>
      <section class="check-understanding" id="sect-00004">
        <exercise id="e97a365f-1e27-4b93-bd6d-96a10e2e7517" class="multiple-choice" id="exer-00012">
          <problem id="prob-00012">
            <para id="para-00041">Enter your answer here:</para>
            <para id="para-00042">Without graphing, find the coordinates of the vertex of \(y=-(x−4)^2+8\) and determine if it opens up or down.</para>
            <para id="para-00043"> What is the \(x\)-coordinate of the vertex?</para>
          </problem>
          <solution id="sol-00011">
            <para id="para-00044">Correct! The \(x\)-coordinate of the vertex of this equation is 4.</para>
            <para id="para-00045">The correct answer is is 4. The x-coordinate of the vertex of this equation is 4.</para>
          </solution>
        </exercise>
        <exercise id="cc967510-ac1e-4d56-9e53-cfdeb3d963a6" class="multiple-choice" id="exer-00013">
          <problem id="prob-00013">
            <para id="para-00046">Enter your answer here:</para>
            <para id="para-00047"> What is the \(y\)-coordinate of the vertex?</para>
          </problem>
          <solution id="sol-00012">
            <para id="para-00048">Correct! The \(y\)-coordinate of the vertex of this equation is 8.</para>
            <para id="para-00049">The correct answer is is 8. The \(y\)-coordinate of the vertex of this equation is 8.</para>
          </solution>
        </exercise>
        <exercise id="82feb2b3-eeb0-4f87-a8d9-d9ec880ba7e9" class="multiple-choice" id="exer-00014">
          <problem id="prob-00014">
            <para id="para-00050"> Does the graph open up or down?</para>
          </problem>
          <solution id="sol-00013">
            <para id="para-00051">Correct! The graph opens downward. The squared term has a negative coefficient (-1).</para>
            <para id="para-00052">Incorrect. The correct answer is Down. The graph opens downward. The squared term has a negative coefficient (-1).</para>
          </solution>
        </exercise>
      </section>
